{'symbol': 'UHS', 'date': '2022-05-18 16:30:00', 'title': 'UNIVERSAL HEALTH SERVICES, INC. ANNOUNCES DIVIDEND', 'text': 'KING OF PRUSSIA, PA. , MAY 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- UNIVERSAL HEALTH SERVICES, INC. (NYSE: UHS) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS VOTED TO PAY A CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.20 PER SHARE ON JUNE 15, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF JUNE 1, 2022.'}